    "description": {
     "extraction_status": "extracted",
     "value": "PET scans of 30 min were acquired starting 40 min after intravenous injection of 4.8 MBq/kg 18F-FDG. Subjects fasted for at least 4 h before PET imaging. In-plane and axial resolution were 4.9 and 3.9 mm FWHM, respectively. Images were reconstructed using a Hanning filter with cutoff frequency 4.5 mm and displayed in a 128 \u00d7 128 matrix with pixel size 1.95 \u00d7 1.95 mm and slice thickness 4.25 mm. Attenuation correction used a uniform attenuation coefficient of \u03bc = 0.096 cm\u22121.",
